WEBVTT

00:00:13.833 --> 00:00:16.333
[motorcycle rumbling]

00:00:20.291 --> 00:00:21.875
Uh, Carrots?

00:00:23.333 --> 00:00:24.333
Ugh.

00:00:24.416 --> 00:00:25.541
[gasps]

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.375
-Huh?
-[Nick gasps]

00:00:29.458 --> 00:00:30.708
Carrots!

00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:33.291
[grunts]

00:00:42.791 --> 00:00:44.041
EBENEZER LYNXLEY'S PLAN
FOR ALL ANIMALS

00:00:44.125 --> 00:00:45.125
MARRED BY SNAKE ATTACK

00:00:50.458 --> 00:00:54.041
TUNDRATOWN EXPANDS!
EXPANSION OF TUNDRATOWN

00:00:54.125 --> 00:00:56.125
[♪ dramatic music playing]

00:00:57.166 --> 00:00:59.666
find home
Reptile District WHERE?

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:02.500
There was a whole
reptile neighborhood.

00:01:05.375 --> 00:01:06.375
Their home...

00:01:09.125 --> 00:01:11.375
The lynxes just erased it.

00:01:11.458 --> 00:01:13.500
This is what they do.

00:01:13.583 --> 00:01:15.833
[Nick panting] We have to go.

00:01:15.916 --> 00:01:19.583
They push animals out with
lies so they can have more.

00:01:19.666 --> 00:01:20.666
We gotta go.
Carrots, we gotta go!

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:22.166
That's what
the snake's trying to prove.

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:24.000
The ZPD is here.

00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:25.416
What?

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:27.458
No one will believe us.
Not without proof.

00:01:27.541 --> 00:01:30.000
Leave it. They aren't gonna
just arrest us.

00:01:30.083 --> 00:01:31.041
The lynxes want us dead.

00:01:31.125 --> 00:01:32.875
We need it to solve the case.

00:01:32.958 --> 00:01:35.500
-Judy, just...
-We have to solve the case.

00:01:35.583 --> 00:01:37.291
-Nick...
-I don't care about the case!

00:01:37.375 --> 00:01:38.375
[♪ music stops]

00:01:39.125 --> 00:01:41.666
[stammers, sighs] Judy,
it's not worth dying for.

00:01:44.708 --> 00:01:47.375
The world will never be
a better place

00:01:47.458 --> 00:01:50.333
if no one is brave enough
to do the right thing.

00:01:50.416 --> 00:01:52.208
The world is what it is,
Carrots,

00:01:52.291 --> 00:01:55.541
and sometimes being a hero...

00:01:56.541 --> 00:01:59.416
it just doesn't
make a difference.

00:02:04.041 --> 00:02:05.041
[sighs]

00:02:06.875 --> 00:02:07.958
I think, uh...

00:02:10.791 --> 00:02:13.166
I think maybe...

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:14.375
maybe we...

00:02:17.291 --> 00:02:18.875
are different.

00:02:18.958 --> 00:02:20.875
-[thuds]
-[grunts]

00:02:20.958 --> 00:02:22.416
[yelps]

00:02:22.958 --> 00:02:24.500
[yelps]

00:02:24.583 --> 00:02:25.583
-[grunts]
-[yelps]

00:02:27.125 --> 00:02:28.291
[gasps]

00:02:32.375 --> 00:02:33.208
[Judy yelps]

00:02:33.291 --> 00:02:34.375
[grunting]

00:02:34.458 --> 00:02:35.916
[gasping]

00:02:37.083 --> 00:02:38.500
[Nick yelps]

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:41.541
-Mmm.
-[grunts]

00:02:42.916 --> 00:02:44.583
[panting]

00:02:47.291 --> 00:02:48.250
[Bûcheron grunts]

00:02:48.333 --> 00:02:50.125
[gasps, pants]

00:02:50.708 --> 00:02:52.166
[grunts, groans]

00:02:53.541 --> 00:02:55.750
Oh, my gosh,
I think I just took out a cop.

00:02:55.833 --> 00:02:57.208
Uh. Sorry, sir!

00:02:57.291 --> 00:02:59.791
-Pawbert?
-Yeah. It's, uh... you know...

00:02:59.875 --> 00:03:02.333
-We're the good guys!
-I told you she's helping.

00:03:02.416 --> 00:03:03.500
-[floor creaking]
-[Judy yelps]

00:03:04.291 --> 00:03:05.916
[panting]

00:03:07.791 --> 00:03:09.458
-Come with us.
-[Pawbert grunting]

00:03:10.208 --> 00:03:12.041
-Ow.
-We have the fox.

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:14.000
-We have the fox!
-[whimpers]

00:03:14.708 --> 00:03:16.208
They already have
your partner.

00:03:16.958 --> 00:03:19.000
They can't get you too.

00:03:19.583 --> 00:03:21.916
Please. We can stop my family.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:23.916
-[grunting]
-[groans]

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.416
[♪ dramatic music playing]

00:03:27.458 --> 00:03:28.291
[grunts]

00:03:28.375 --> 00:03:29.791
[pants, yelps]

00:03:29.875 --> 00:03:31.083
[Judy grunting]

00:03:33.416 --> 00:03:34.625
[Nick whimpering]

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:38.000
-[grunting]
-Judy!

00:03:38.083 --> 00:03:39.833
-[groans]
-No, no, no!

00:03:42.291 --> 00:03:43.500
I got you.

00:03:46.541 --> 00:03:48.125
[panting]

00:03:56.791 --> 00:03:58.083
[exhales]

00:03:58.666 --> 00:04:00.833
All right. Here we go.

00:04:05.583 --> 00:04:07.583
-[engine running]
-[Judy exhales]

00:04:14.583 --> 00:04:15.791
What?

00:04:15.875 --> 00:04:18.208
[♪ mysterious music playing]

00:04:26.625 --> 00:04:27.750
Huh.

00:04:28.666 --> 00:04:30.708
-You're not dead! [laughs]
-[yelps]

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:33.208
-She's not dead!
-[chuckles]

00:04:33.291 --> 00:04:35.250
[grunts] Sorry, sorry.

00:04:35.333 --> 00:04:37.041
I just got
my motorcycle license.

00:04:40.458 --> 00:04:41.458
Nick?

00:04:42.208 --> 00:04:43.625
They, uh...

00:04:44.291 --> 00:04:45.583
They caught him.

00:04:49.083 --> 00:04:52.750
But out here,
no one's gonna catch us.

00:04:55.666 --> 00:04:56.666
[grunting]

00:04:57.750 --> 00:04:59.541
Mayor Winddancer.

00:05:00.875 --> 00:05:01.875
[snorts]

00:05:06.208 --> 00:05:07.458
Where's the bunny?

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.708
I don't know.

00:05:09.791 --> 00:05:11.750
But, you know, she's a rabbit.

00:05:11.833 --> 00:05:13.625
So maybe you can
pull her out of your hat.

00:05:14.958 --> 00:05:16.333
I'm not wearing a hat.

00:05:16.416 --> 00:05:17.750
He's messing with you, sir.

00:05:17.833 --> 00:05:19.750
I knew that.
Get him out of here.

00:05:21.083 --> 00:05:22.125
No.

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.125
[♪ tense music playing]

00:05:26.208 --> 00:05:28.791
Where are they, Mr. Wilde?

00:05:30.541 --> 00:05:31.875
[sighs]

00:05:31.958 --> 00:05:33.416
Begin the expansion.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:34.833
Freeze Marsh Market.

00:05:34.916 --> 00:05:36.958
-Flush everyone out.
-What? No, you can't--

00:05:37.041 --> 00:05:42.541
Water folk, like foxes,
are lesser mammals.

00:05:42.625 --> 00:05:45.708
If I say they helped
a dangerous snake,

00:05:45.791 --> 00:05:48.125
no one will care what we do.

00:05:48.208 --> 00:05:50.000
[Nick groans]

00:05:50.083 --> 00:05:52.916
You're going
to a dark cell, Mr. Wilde.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:56.041
Just long enough
to read the headline

00:05:56.125 --> 00:05:58.291
of your partner's demise.

00:05:58.791 --> 00:05:59.666
[Nick groans]

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:04.666
You should've left town
when you had the chance.

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:06.125
[engine starts]

